Name: Ghoti.io Lang-tang(BRANCH)
Description: The Tang engine of the language runtime stack: the parser and syntax tree ported from ctang, a compiler to a new bytecode, and an interpreter that runs on runtime-core frames and a runtime-heap collector.
Version: (VERSION)
URL: https://github.com/Ghoti-io/lang-tang
Libs: -L(PC_LIB_DIR) -l(SUITE)-(PROJECT)(BRANCH) -pthread
CFlags: -I(PC_INCLUDE_DIR)
Requires: (REQUIRES)
